          <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-purple">Pillar 03</span>
          <h3 class="mt-2 font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-ink">
            <span class="italic font-serif text-gold-hover">Community</span> & Service
          </h3>
